# Keep Railway deploy archives lean and robust. None of these are needed by any
# service build (server NIXPACKS workspace, or the brouter Dockerfiles).
#
# NOTE the leading slash on /data/. A bare `data/` matches a directory named
# `data` at ANY depth, which silently swallowed server/data/bike-network.geojson
# — the 9 MB PBOT network index that greenway-coverage.ts loads at runtime. The
# server still boots without it and just logs a warning, so the only symptom is
# every route coming back with greenway_coverage: 0. Keep this anchored.
.claude/
/data/
ios/
*.xcodeproj
